<div id="block-brand-mainpagecontent" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
	
	
	

			<div class="content">
			<h1 class="sr-only">Home</h1>

<div class="homepage">
	<div class="desktop-scroll-container d-none d-lg-block" aria-hidden="true">
		<div class="desktop-scroll-container__inner">

									<div id="pause-button" class="pause-button d-none d-lg-block"></div> 
					

		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container-fluid">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12">
				<div class="homepage__header-wrap">
											<div aria-hidden="true" class="homepage__video fullbleed-wrapper d-none d-lg-block">
								<video  autoplay="autoplay" muted="muted" width="640" height="480">
      <source  src="/sites/default/files/2024-02/MIT%20Brand%20Animation_R6.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>


						</div>
					
					<div class="homepage__hero-text d-lg-none">
							<p>MIT’s brand communicates <em>our&nbsp;impact in the world.</em></p>

					</div>

											<div id="anchor" class="homepage__intro-text">
								<p>Leverage the brand in your communications to share in the energy and excellence that defines MIT.</p>

						</div>
					
					<a href="#anchor" class="scroll-cue scroll-cue-md" tabindex="-1"></a>
				</div>

				<div class="homepage__body">
					<span ></span>
						<div class="homepage__image-paragraph fullbleed-wrapper">
    	

<div class="media-item media-item--type-image media-item--view-mode-homepage">
	
		    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_1x/public/2023-08/shirts.png?itok=AM_CE43a 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_2x/public/2023-08/shirts.png?itok=6RJqIRef 2x" media="all and (min-width: 1080px)" type="image/png" width="1150" height="643"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_tablet_1x/public/2023-08/shirts.png?itok=ZrSMgLLw 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_tablet_2x/public/2023-08/shirts.png?itok=cqlkpSCB 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/png" width="768" height="430"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_mobile_1x/public/2023-08/shirts.png?itok=3RrW-oC7 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_mobile_2x/public/2023-08/shirts.png?itok=l3nrYT6y 2x" type="image/png" width="576" height="322"/>
                  <img loading="lazy" width="2300" height="1287" src="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_2x/public/2023-08/shirts.png?itok=6RJqIRef" alt="Conceptual designs of a black t-shirt that says Massachusetts Institute of Technology in white next to an MIT red hooded sweatshirt with a bright red MIT logo." />

  </picture>



</div>



            <div class="image-caption ">
            	Conceptual designs

        </div>    
    </div>

	<div class="homepage__text-paragraph">
    <h2>	Optimized
</h2>
    
    	<p>The MIT logo is recognized around the world. We’ve simplified and modernized it to work more effectively across today’s many communications environments.</p>


            <div class="btn btn-primary">
            	<a href="/logos-marks">See logos &amp; marks</a>

        </div>
    </div>
	<div class="homepage__image-paragraph fullbleed-wrapper">
    	

<div class="media-item media-item--type-image media-item--view-mode-homepage">
	
		    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_1x/public/2023-08/home-image-bag_2_0.png?itok=MIKKkJuG 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_2x/public/2023-08/home-image-bag_2_0.png?itok=GIreDXH_ 2x" media="all and (min-width: 1080px)" type="image/png" width="1150" height="647"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_tablet_1x/public/2023-08/home-image-bag_2_0.png?itok=reRazS1m 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_tablet_2x/public/2023-08/home-image-bag_2_0.png?itok=9n3AxU1R 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/png" width="768" height="432"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_mobile_1x/public/2023-08/home-image-bag_2_0.png?itok=D6luhDLD 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_mobile_2x/public/2023-08/home-image-bag_2_0.png?itok=WTLCXoGJ 2x" type="image/png" width="576" height="324"/>
                  <img loading="lazy" width="2300" height="1294" src="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_2x/public/2023-08/home-image-bag_2_0.png?itok=GIreDXH_" alt="Conceptual designs of a sticker, confetti tote bag, and mind and hand button with the MIT logo and branded design elements." />

  </picture>



</div>



            <div class="image-caption white">
            	Conceptual designs

        </div>    
    </div>

		<div class="spacer" style="margin-bottom: 10px"></div>

	<div class="homepage__text-paragraph">
    <h2>	Bold
</h2>
    
    	<p>With more vibrant core colors and an exciting secondary palette, our brand system embodies MIT’s vitality and dynamism and provides new opportunities for creative expression.</p>


            <div class="btn btn-primary">
            	<a href="/color">Explore our color palette</a>

        </div>
    </div>
	<div class="homepage__image-paragraph fullbleed-wrapper">
    	

<div class="media-item media-item--type-image media-item--view-mode-homepage">
	
		    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_1x/public/2023-09/3posters-revised2.png?itok=w3CeOwWz 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_2x/public/2023-09/3posters-revised2.png?itok=MrT3QT3x 2x" media="all and (min-width: 1080px)" type="image/png" width="1150" height="647"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_tablet_1x/public/2023-09/3posters-revised2.png?itok=bZt_oR_Z 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_tablet_2x/public/2023-09/3posters-revised2.png?itok=CRI_qFqg 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/png" width="768" height="432"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_mobile_1x/public/2023-09/3posters-revised2.png?itok=OeS6xYvR 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/homepage_mobile_2x/public/2023-09/3posters-revised2.png?itok=ETRKY_r- 2x" type="image/png" width="576" height="324"/>
                  <img loading="lazy" width="2300" height="1293" src="/sites/default/files/styles/homepage_desktop_2x/public/2023-09/3posters-revised2.png?itok=MrT3QT3x" alt="Conceptual design of three event posters that showcase the colors and typography from the MIT brand system." />

  </picture>



</div>



            <div class="image-caption ">
            	Conceptual designs

        </div>    
    </div>

	<div class="homepage__text-paragraph">
    <h2>	Unified
</h2>
    
    	<p>A simplified brand architecture helps us tell our story more clearly and consistently, making it easier to bring the MIT brand to life.</p>


            <div class="btn btn-primary">
            	<a href="/brand-architecture">Learn about MIT’s brand architecture</a>

